This repository contains the public edition of the research manuscript
"Preserving Facts between Computation and Explanation: A Boundary-Case Study
of a Local Saju Language Model", its analysis code, and preserved observations.
The author's original manuscript, code, and accompanying original documentation
are made available under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See LICENSE.

The observed requests and responses are preserved as research records, including
unsuccessful outputs. Their inclusion does not grant rights in model weights or
change the model provider's terms. The recorded model identifier is the local
runtime tag gemma4:26b-mlx, not a redistribution of that model.

External astronomical facts were transcribed from page 8 of the Korea Astronomy
and Space Science Institute's published 2025 and 2026 almanacs. Bibliographic
metadata, source URLs, page numbers and source-document SHA-256 values are in
evidence/kasi-oracle/source_manifest.json. The complete almanac PDFs are not
included. Citations and factual fixtures do not imply KASI endorsement or a
license grant over KASI's publications.

Model weights, the audited calendar engine and its SQLite database, commercial
font programs, and complete third-party publications are not distributed here.
The typeset paper names Yoon fonts; their font programs and activation settings
are not part of this repository's Apache license. Third-party names and marks
remain those of their respective owners. Referenced publications and datasets
are cited in the manuscript; they are not relicensed by this repository.

Public-edition changes on 2026-11-03: host-specific checkout paths were removed;
research prose and the reproduction boundary were revised for public readers;
analysis writes derived files outside the preserved evidence directory. Twenty
research evidence files, including all 132 requests and raw responses and the
original frozen-input hashes, retain their original bytes. A derived provenance
record explicitly identifies its changes and the hashes of its source documents.

